  "final_message": "I did not remove `channel` from [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26) or the order model.\n\nUnder architecture rule **ARCH-4**, [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26) is consumed across repositories by downstream services (`billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`). Removing an existing event field is a breaking change for deployed consumers; removals and renames must follow a deprecation cycle. \n\nInstead, I marked `channel` as `@deprecated` on [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L16-L20) in [events.ts](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L16-L20). It can be safely removed once the Data team confirms `analytics-ingest` no longer reads it.\n",
